  "instructions": [
    "Preheat the oil in a deep frying pan to 350 degrees Fahrenheit.",
    "In a bowl, mix together the crushed amaretti cookies and kimchi.",
    "Add the Thai red curry paste to the cookie-kimchi mixture and stir well.",
    "Dip each tofu cube into the cookie-kimchi mixture, coating evenly.",
    "Fry the coated tofu cubes in the preheated oil until crispy and golden brown.",
    "In a separate pan, heat the coconut milk over medium heat.",
    "Add the fried tofu cubes to the coconut milk and stir gently.",
    "Season with salt and pepper to taste.",
    "Garnish with chopped scallions and serve in a kanom-ko form."
